WEBVTT

01:00:57.211 --> 01:01:02.302
is that you have to really
turn up the level of concern?

01:01:02.326 --> 01:01:05.765
You have to scare the frog to leap
out of their nearly boiling pot,

01:01:05.789 --> 01:01:08.009
otherwise, it will just fester there?

01:01:08.033 --> 01:01:10.992
But, others believe it can't just be that,

01:01:11.016 --> 01:01:14.816
that if that's pushed too far,
you have no reason to do anything.

01:01:14.840 --> 01:01:19.024
It's some mixture of a belief
that a solution can be found

01:01:19.048 --> 01:01:20.210
coupled with that.

01:01:20.234 --> 01:01:21.666
Has anyone researched that?

01:01:21.690 --> 01:01:25.055
It seems to me that's such
an important topic, because, I mean,

01:01:25.079 --> 01:01:27.858
the future of our species kind of hangs on

01:01:27.882 --> 01:01:33.314
us collectively generating the conditions
whereby enough people get off their asses